        to be returned
  * Outputs:
      * a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, the cells of C

Description
===========

Given a cell complex, this function will return all the cells in that cell
complex, index by dimension. The order of the cells in each dimension is
arbitrary.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : vx = newSimplexCell({},x);                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : vy = newSimplexCell({},y);                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : vz = newSimplexCell({},z);                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : exy = newSimplexCell {vx,vy};                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : C = cellComplex(R,{exy,vz});                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : cells(C)                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = HashTable{0 => {Cell of dimension 0 with label z, Cell of dimension 0   |
|               1 => {Cell of dimension 1 with label x*y}                     |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : HashTable                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|with label x, Cell of dimension 0 with label y}}                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : R = QQ;                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : P = convexHull matrix {{1,1,-1,-1},{1,-1,1,-1}};                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : C = cellComplex(R,P);                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : cells C                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = HashTable{0 => {Cell of dimension 0 with label 1, Cell of dimension 0  |
|                1 => {Cell of dimension 1 with label 1, Cell of dimension 1  |
|                2 => {Cell of dimension 2 with label 1}                      |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : HashTable                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|with label 1, Cell of dimension 0 with label 1, Cell of dimension 0 with     |
|with label 1, Cell of dimension 1 with label 1, Cell of dimension 1 with     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|label 1}}                                                                    |
|label 1}                                                                     |
