    cell complex
  * *note HH_ZZ CellComplex: HH_usZZ CellComplex, -- compute the homology
    modules of a cell complex
  * *note complex(CellComplex): complex_lpCellComplex_rp, -- compute the
    cellular chain complex for a cell complex

