newSimplexCell -- create a new cell
***********************************

  * Usage: 
        newSimplexCell(boundary,label)
        newSimplexCell(boundary)
  * Inputs:
      * boundary, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, that gives the boundary of
        the new cell either as a list of pairs of cells and their orientation,
