relabelCellComplex -- relabels a cell complex
*********************************************

  * Usage: 
        relabelCellComplex(C,H)
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note cell complex: CellComplex,, 
      * H, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, whose keys are cells
        of C and whose corresponding value is the cell's new label
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * InferLabels => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default
        value true
  * Outputs:
      * a *note cell complex: CellComplex,, whose cells are relabeled by the
        values in the hashtable H

Description
===========

Given a cell complex C and a hashtable, whose key-value pairs are a cell from C
and a new label for that cell, this command relabels C accordingly. Labels for
cells not provided in the hashtable are inferred to be the least common
multiple of the labels of their boundary cells, unless the option InferLabels
is set to false.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : P1 = convexHull matrix {{0,1,0},{0,0,1}};                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : P2 = convexHull matrix {{1,0,1},{0,1,1}};                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : P = polyhedralComplex {P1,P2};                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : C = cellComplex(R,P);                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : verts = cells(0,C);                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : v0 = verts#0;                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : v1 = verts#1;                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : v2 = verts#2;                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : v3 = verts#3;                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : T = new HashTable from {v0 => a^2*b, v1 => b*c^2, v2 => b^2, v3 =>     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|a*c};                                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : relabeledC = relabelCellComplex(C,T);                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : for c in cells(0,relabeledC) list cellLabel(c)                         |
|                                                                             |
|        2      2   2                                                         |
|o13 = {a b, b*c , b , a*c}                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o13 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : for c in cells(1,relabeledC) list cellLabel(c)                         |
|                                                                             |
|        2 2       2   2 2   2   2     2                                      |
|o14 = {a b , a*b*c , b c , a b*c , a*b c}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o14 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

